 "remarks": "Welcome home to 77 Glenbrook Road, #101! This bright & cheerful one-bedroom, one-bath corner unit offers 650 sq ft of comfortable, easy living in a convenient Stamford location. With lots of natural light, high ceilings, & beautiful hardwood floors, the apartment has a warm & welcoming feel from the moment you walk in. The renovated kitchen features granite countertops, & the updated bath keeps things fresh and move-in ready. You'll love being close to downtown Stamford, shopping, restaurants, & transportation, while still having a comfortable place to come home to & unwind. Assigned parking means no searching for a spot, & there's also a private storage unit & laundry in the basement for added convenience. Bright, comfortable, & easy to call home. Come take a look! Good credit required. Sorry, no pets.",
